<section style="padding:72px 24px 40px;"><div style="max-width:860px;margin:0 auto;"><div class="rich"><p>Ocean Grove sits on the Bellarine Peninsula, and plenty of the town is still the older holiday housing that went up while asbestos cement sheeting was ordinary building material. Those places are being renovated, extended and knocked down now, and that is usually the moment asbestos surfaces. It turns up as a wall sheet behind the plaster, an eaves lining, a shed wall, or the fence down the side that nobody looked at twice until someone took a grinder to it.</p><p>We are not a licensed removalist and we do not carry out removal ourselves. What we do is get the material identified properly at a NATA accredited laboratory, and put you in touch with licensed asbestos removalists whose WorkSafe Victoria licence number appears on every quote they give you. You contract with the removalist directly. If you have already disturbed something and you are worried about it, stop, leave it alone, and call now on 0480 XXX XXX.</p></div></div></section>
<section style="padding:0 24px 64px;"><div style="max-width:1100px;margin:0 auto;">
    <span class="kicker">What We Do in Ocean Grove</span>
    <h2 class="section-heading" style="font-size:clamp(22px,3vw,32px);margin:0 0 28px;">Services for Ocean Grove Properties</h2>
    <div class="feat-grid" style="display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(2,1fr);gap:20px;">
      <div style="background:#fff;border:1px solid #e3ded4;border-radius:10px;padding:26px;box-shadow:0 2px 8px rgba(14,77,110,0.05);">
        <h3 style="font-family:'Nunito Sans',sans-serif;font-size:18px;font-weight:800;color:#0A3D5C;margin:0 0 8px;">Asbestos testing and identification</h3>
        <p style="font-size:14.5px;line-height:1.7;color:#555;margin:0;">You cannot tell asbestos cement from modern fibre cement by looking at it, and in a 1960s Ocean Grove shack the two often sit side by side. A sample goes to a NATA accredited laboratory, standard results come back in one to five business days, and <a href="/asbestos-testing-geelong/">testing</a> runs $88 to $160 per sample.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="background:#fff;border:1px solid #e3ded4;border-radius:10px;padding:26px;box-shadow:0 2px 8px rgba(14,77,110,0.05);">
        <h3 style="font-family:'Nunito Sans',sans-serif;font-size:18px;font-weight:800;color:#0A3D5C;margin:0 0 8px;">Fibro fence removal</h3>
        <p style="font-size:14.5px;line-height:1.7;color:#555;margin:0;">Cracked, flaking or weathered fibro fences are common on the peninsula's older blocks, and it is the damaged sheets that matter rather than the intact ones. A full fence line is well past what anyone may do as unlicensed work, so it goes to a licensed removalist. See <a href="/asbestos-fence-removal-geelong/">asbestos fence removal</a>.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="background:#fff;border:1px solid #e3ded4;border-radius:10px;padding:26px;box-shadow:0 2px 8px rgba(14,77,110,0.05);">
        <h3 style="font-family:'Nunito Sans',sans-serif;font-size:18px;font-weight:800;color:#0A3D5C;margin:0 0 8px;">Roof, garage and shed sheeting</h3>
        <p style="font-size:14.5px;line-height:1.7;color:#555;margin:0;">Super Six corrugated roofing, garage walls and shed cladding are the bigger jobs on an older Ocean Grove block. Never water blast, drill, dry sweep or walk on them, because that is what turns a solid sheet into loose fibres. See <a href="/asbestos-roof-removal-geelong/">roof and shed removal</a>.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="background:#fff;border:1px solid #e3ded4;border-radius:10px;padding:26px;box-shadow:0 2px 8px rgba(14,77,110,0.05);">
        <h3 style="font-family:'Nunito Sans',sans-serif;font-size:18px;font-weight:800;color:#0A3D5C;margin:0 0 8px;">Disposal</h3>
        <p style="font-size:14.5px;line-height:1.7;color:#555;margin:0;">Asbestos can only go to a landfill licensed to receive it, and EPA Victoria's register lists exactly one in the whole Barwon region. It is Drysdale Landfill, here on the Bellarine, and it takes small domestic quantities only. See <a href="/asbestos-disposal-geelong/">asbestos disposal</a>.</p>
      </div>
</div>
